Marc and others who find themselves dying from group attacks:

You need to develop techniques for careful fighting, such as backing
into a corridor, running away, teleporting, preventing attacks with
a special technique (which *is* in the spoiler files), etc.

My personal favorite technique is to have Telepathy.  I can then "see"
monsters before they are aware of me.  I throw weapons before getting
close enough to be hit, I'll even tunnel a corridor into a room in order
to throw stuff and be able to back up to throw stuff as they come after
me one at a time.... It's a lot easier to survive until you get your
wand of wishing and your +3 gray dragon scale mail, +3 gauntlets of
power, +3 shield of reflection, and 100 or more hit points through
gaining experience levels.  Also a Stealth intrinsic is nice for
the beehives and zoos, etc.

Good luck!
